stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Running
  Running --> Exited : process ends
  Running --> KilledTimeout : wall clock cap fires
  Running --> KilledCap : output byte cap fires
  Exited --> Passed : exit 0 and checks pass
  Exited --> Failed : exit nonzero or checks fail
  KilledTimeout --> Failed : passed is false
  KilledCap --> Failed : passed is false
  Passed --> [*]
  Failed --> [*]
